  "name": "Text-Code-CodeSearchNet-Python",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset is imported from CodeXGLUE and pre-processed using their script.\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tWhere to find in Semeru:\n\t\n\nThe dataset can be found at /nfs/semeru/semeru_datasets/code_xglue/text-to-code/codesearchnet/python in Semeru\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCodeXGLUE -- Code Search (AdvTest)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTask Definition\n\t\n\nGiven a natural language, the task is to search source code that matches the natural language. To test the generalization ability of a model,  function names and variables in test sets are\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/semeru/Text-Code-CodeSearchNet-Python.",
